      "review_summary": "The PR replaces OpenShell’s unbounded sandbox file-handle read with a 100 MiB asynchronous chunked-read cap in `extensions/openshell/src/fs-bridge.ts`.\n\nPR surface: Source +30. Total +30 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source: the prior bridge called `FileHandle.readFile()` without a byte limit after opening a sandbox path. The supplied material does not include a current-head live reproduction using an oversized file.",
